# 00-DF one byte; E0 xx = glyph 0xE0+xx. Control codes: see docs/re/text.md.
# Kana, digits, Latin: verified (decoded known on-screen line, scene 0x2C: ゴーストハントなんて).
# Kanji E00A-E0BF: first pass read off the font; E014-E0B3 are in on'yomi gojuon order, which backs the reading.
# Lines tagged "# ?" are guesses to confirm from script context in phase 4.
